        "Prove common finite approximation and quantitative gate-strip/rounding and beta-loss payment in the original fixed-policy parameter order.",
        "Supply signed smooth singleton and lower-trim PP estimates for the identical rounded physical rho, including actual factorization, support, squares, buffers, factorials and common beta choices.",
        "Complete PNT normalization and the eventual scalar originalGroupedStarts inequality. The proved plain-root limit does not establish that endpoint.",
        "Install pinned draft imports in the recorded order and obtain separate elaboration/kernel evidence; source review provides no such evidence."
